@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam packageBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
title Document navigation — 00 through 15
top to bottom direction
rectangle "README + 00\nEntry and reading route" as entry
rectangle "01 Purpose / scope\n02 Context / boundaries" as context
rectangle "03 Domain\n04 Functions\n05 Data" as structural
rectangle "06 Scenarios / 07 States\n08 Activities / 09 Rules\n10 Constraints and contracts" as behavior
rectangle "12 External interfaces\n13 Security / quality / operations" as cross
rectangle "15 Current-process evidence\nActual evidence versus hypotheses" as evidence
rectangle "11 Consistency / traceability\nReview affected views together" as review
rectangle "14 Conditional design handoff" as handoff
entry --> context : establish meaning
context --> structural : refine
structural --> behavior : complementary views
context --> cross : boundary questions
evidence --> review : evidence limits
structural --> review : model associations
behavior --> review : behavior consistency
cross --> review : cross-cutting constraints
review --> handoff : identified candidate + unresolved gates

legend bottom
Reading dependencies, not a waterfall schedule or an accepted milestone.
endlegend
@enduml
